We need to call tool search_template_catalog_by_criteria. Let's search for amide formation forward: functional_groups_broken ["acyl chloride"], functional_groups_formed ["amide"] maybe.


{
    "tool_name": "search_template_catalog_by_criteria",
    "arguments": {
        "molecule_smiles": "COc1cccc(NC(=O)c2nnn(Cc3ccc(CN4CC(F)C4)cc3)c2N)c1",
        "functional_groups_broken": ["acyl chloride"],
        "functional_groups_formed": ["amide"],
        "limit": 5
    }
}
